4. How a Project Uses It
The project calls the central reusable module and passes environment-specific values.



module "vpc" {
  source = "git::<CENTRAL_TERRAFORM_REPO>//Modules/networking/vpc-baseline?ref=<VPC_MODULE_VERSION>"
  name       = var.vpc_name
  vpc_cidr   = var.vpc_cidr
  az_subnets = var.az_subnets
  interface_endpoints    = var.interface_endpoints
  gateway_endpoints      = var.gateway_endpoints
  endpoint_ingress_cidrs = var.endpoint_ingress_cidrs
  tags = var.tags
}
 

