The module can start with one AZ.



az_subnets = {
  "us-east-1a" = {
    workload_cidr = var.workload_cidr
    endpoint_cidr = var.endpoint_cidr
    nlb_cidr      = var.nlb_cidr
    tgw_cidr      = var.tgw_cidr
  }
}
Additional AZs can be added later through the same input map without changing the reusable module code.

